# NihongoTracker API key - https://nihongotracker.app -> settings -> API keys
#
# Optional. Adds the hours and episodes you have actually logged beside each
# tracked title. The match is on the AniList and VNDB ids both sites already
# store, so nothing is guessed from titles. Without it you lose that column
# and nothing else.
#
# NOT read-only: this key is accepted on every endpoint your account can
# reach, including the ones that delete logs. Treat it like your password.
#
# Paste the key on its own line below. Lines starting with # are ignored.

